- `docs/preview/fromjson_dots.riv`, `fromjson_easing.riv` — rebuilt (structurally consistent)
- Deleted: mixed_bg_test, autumn_sky_last, ellipse_test (.json + .riv)
- `docs/preview/index.html` — removed 3 diagnostic cards, count updated to six

### All tests pass
